        <mxCell id="note" value="Crime: the weekly fetcher downloads the AH-Datalytics raw CSV and stores diagnostics. compute_index uses the locked 2723 rate until a reviewed revision. An unreadable download is a core failure and the job refuses to publish. Homelessness and trust are rows in runtime/data/annual_inputs.csv. Homelessness observation_date is the HUD reference date and fetched_at stays empty. Trust observation_date is the Edelman survey year only. The Edelman CSV is an archive. UNKNOWN: exact GitHub Pages CDN edge nodes beyond standard Pages hosting." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;size=14;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
